// P3G.2 (external-references.md ER3.3–ER3.6; intro-to-drawings.md D2.10;
// lesson-referencing-versions-within-a-document.png): Change to version… and back to the
// workspace in one document, "Block versions" (the Part Studio "Block", 50 × 30 × 25, and
// Assembly 1 with the Block part at the workspace: `linked-block versions-instance`); V1 made
// from the top bar.
// 01 Assembly 1: "Part 1 <1>", no version icon (it follows the workspace).
// 02 (ER3.3) right-click → "Change to version…" hovered.
// 03 the Reference manager: "Block versions" "Workspace ⇒ V1".
// 04 Update all: the row shows the version icon; its tooltip "Linked document: Block versions ›
//    Block (V1) (this document)".
// 05 (ER3.4) the studio's Extrude 1 set to 40 (`linked-block height 40`): the instance stays 25
//    high; the assembly (its one instance) selected, mass properties 37 500 mm³.
// 06 (ER3.4) V2 made from the top bar: the blue badge on the row and the tab.
// 07 (ER3.6) its icon → Selective update → the version graph: Main (this document: selectable),
//    V2, V1, Start.
// 08 Main picked: "V1 ⇒ Workspace".
// 09 Update selected: the instance follows the workspace again (no icon, 40 high).
// 10 its mass properties: 60 000 mm³.
// 11 (D2.10) "Drawing 1" of the Block studio (a Front view of the workspace, `linked-block
//    versions-drawing`): right-click its tab → "Change to version…" hovered.
// 12 the manager: "Block versions" "Workspace ⇒ V2".
// 13 Update all, then the studio set to 60 (`linked-block height 60`): the view stays 40 high
//    (V2), never out of date; the Sheets pane names "V2" on the reference and the view.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("linked-block"),
        Custom("linked-block versions"),
        Custom("linked-block versions-instance"),
        Click(ui("document-create-version")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Click(ui("create-version-create")),
        Click(ui("tab-assembly-1")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-workspace-instance"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-1")),
        WaitFor("assembly-context-menu"),
        Hover(ui("asm-version")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("02-change-to-version-menu"),
        Click(ui("asm-version")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-workspace-to-v1"),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("04-now-at-v1"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Custom("linked-block height 40"),
        Click(ui("instance-root")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "37500.000"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-frozen-37500"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(ui("document-create-version")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Click(ui("create-version-create")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-v2-badge"),
        Click(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        Click(ui("refman-tabs-1")),
        Click(ui("refman-graph-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-graph-with-main"),
        Click(ui("refman-graph-node-0")),
        Screenshot("08-main-picked"),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-back-to-workspace"),
        // The instance's part is the workspace's again: measure the whole assembly (it only).
        Click(ui("instance-root")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-mass-60000"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Custom("linked-block versions-drawing"),
        RightClick(ui("tab-drawing-1")),
        WaitFor("tab-context-menu"),
        Hover(ui("tab-change-version")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("11-drawing-tab-change-to-version"),
        Click(ui("tab-change-version")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-drawing-workspace-to-v2"),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        Custom("linked-block height 60"),
        Click(ui("drawing-sheets-toggle")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("13-drawing-at-v2"),
    ],
)
